nt,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">OpenAI拟融资300亿美元，投前估值达1.25万亿美元并筹备IPO</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">DeepSeek与MiniMax率先完成合规登记，顺利实现开源与海外授权</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Anthropic将Agent Skills标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌发布智能体计算引擎ACE，为AI智能体提供专属微型虚拟机环境</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/ef68ff4c5f582ea687e38f4a06f7efe3.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌于10月22日正式推出智能体计算引擎（Agent Compute Engine，简称ACE），旨在为AI智能体提供安全、持久且可弹性伸缩的专属计算环境。ACE通过为每个智能体分配硬件隔离的微型虚拟机（microVM），支持智能体安全运行代码、调用工具及操作浏览器。该引擎具备独特的“持久且可暂停”特性，在智能体空闲时自动挂起环境以释放资源，任务触发时可实现不到500毫秒的快速唤醒。在20万个智能体的压测中，ACE通过共享内存和快照复制技术显著提升了单台服务器的承载密度。安全性方面，ACE采用Cloud Hypervisor边界隔离，沙箱内不存储凭据，有效降低数据外泄风险。目前，ACE已服务于Gemini平台及内部强化学习流程，开发者后续可通过Google Cloud直接调用，自主管理智能体环境的镜像、身份与生</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">国产大模型 Kimi K3.1 现身 Arena 竞技场，性能对标 GPT-6 Astra</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/e124310512050357573de65b98226f26.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">国产大模型 Kimi K3.1 近期以代号 Kibitz 现身 Arena 竞技场进行测试，预计将于本月底正式官宣。该模型主攻长程自主任务，强化了游戏与 3D 代码生成能力，并具备操作电脑的 Agent 功能。实测反馈显示，K3.1 在处理复杂图像与 3D 动画生成方面表现出色，性能直追 OpenAI 的 GPT-6 Astra。市场预期 K3.1 有望成为国产模型新标杆，并在 Arena 榜单上冲击 50 分至 60 分区间。行业分析指出，K3.1 若要实现市场翻盘，除性能指标外，还需解决上一代 K3 面临的算力资源瓶颈，提升推理速度并优化性价比，以应对 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash 等高性价比模型的竞争压力。该模型能否在保持高性能的同时，兼顾开发者的可用性与成本控制，将是其后续发展的关键。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">OpenAI拟融资300亿美元，投前估值达1.25万亿美元并筹备IPO</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/d7c9b66cdadb43eb0acbfe4eba475f7c.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">OpenAI正接近完成一轮最高300亿美元的融资，投前估值已达1.25万亿美元。本轮融资由阿联酋投资方与Coatue联合领投，被定位为IPO前的过渡性安排。公司计划在下周末前完成协议签署，最终规模待定。OpenAI首席财务官萨拉·弗里亚尔透露，公司已秘密递交上市申请，目标在2027年实现IPO。此次融资资金将重点用于补强算力供给，OpenAI正同步与阿联酋方面商谈商业协议以获取更多计算资源。尽管面临科技股市场波动及利率上行带来的融资环境挑战，OpenAI仍通过此轮融资储备弹药，并与Anthropic的上市进程共同成为市场评估AI赛道热度的关键指标。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">DeepSeek与MiniMax率先完成合规登记，顺利实现开源与海外授权</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3f4f345fb66e0ec8d6f69fe149474287.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">DeepSeek与MiniMax已率先完成相关合规登记手续，并成功实现大模型技术的开源与海外授权。此前，商务部与科技部于10月16日就修订《中国禁止出口限制出口技术目录》公开征求意见，涵盖大模型、智能体、算力集群及信息处理等23项AI技术。此次两家头部企业的合规进展，明确了政策并非“一刀切”限制出口，而是旨在科学、精准地划定技术监管边界。官方表态显示，在保障国家安全与合规底线的前提下，我国将持续为企业开展规范化的国际技术合作与全球化开源生态建设预留明确的政策空间。这一进展消除了行业对AI技术出口政策转向的担忧，为国内大模型企业参与全球化竞争提供了清晰的合规路径与发展预期。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Anthropic将Agent Skills标准捐赠给Linux基金会旗下AAIF</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b0a5de56a69418894ab836e18b192464.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Anthropic于10月22日宣布，将其Agent Skills开放标准正式捐赠给Linux基金会旗下的Agentic AI Foundation（AAIF），实现该标准由单一公司掌控向社区共同治理的转型。Agent Skills作为智能体的“说明书”，通过包含SKILL.md文件、脚本及模板的文件夹，使智能体能跨平台复用特定任务流程与专业知识。自2025年12月发布以来，该标准已被ChatGPT、Cursor、GitHub Copilot及VS Code等70多个平台集成，公开Skills数量近100万个，累计安装量约2.8亿次。此次捐赠包括名称、标志、GitHub组织及agentskills.io域名，旨在确保该标准保持供应商中立与开放性。此举标志着Anthropic继捐赠Model Context Pr</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
